-performance optical transceiver designed for Ethernet Passive Optical Networks (EPON), offering seamless data transmission at 1.25 Gbps with a 9dBm optical output. With advanced PX20++++ technology, this module provides robust signal strength, making it ideal for EPON OLTs (Optical Line Terminals). Whether for FTTH (Fiber-to-the-Home) deployments or high-speed fiber-optic broadband networks, the VSOL EPON OLT PON SFP Module ensures stable long-distance transmission and is built for scalability, reliability, and cost-effectiveness. This module is a trusted choice for telecom providers, ISPs, and network operators seeking high-performance solutions for their EPON networks.<p></p><p><br></p><h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3><ul><li>1.25G Data Transmission: Ensures high-speed 1.25 Gbps downstream data transmission, ideal for EPON network and FTTH applications.</li><li>9dBm Optical Power: Provides reliable 9dBm optical output power, ensuring optimal performance over long distances and minimal signal loss.</li><li>PX20++++ Technology: Cutting-edge PX20++++ technology enhances signal strength and network stability, even in demanding EPON infrastructure environments.</li><li>Seamless EPON Compatibility: Fully compatible with EPON OLTs and ONUs (Optical Network Units), ensuring smooth integration and hassle-free operation.</li><li>Ideal for FTTH: Perfect for providing fiber-optic broadband services in FTTH (Fiber-to-the-Home) networks, delivering fast and reliable internet to homes and businesses.</li><li>Scalable &amp; Cost-Effective: A cost-effective solution that allows easy expansion of EPON networks without compromising performance.</li><li>Durable Design: Built to withstand environmental factors, ensuring long-term, stable performance in diverse conditions.</li></ul><h3><b><br></b></h3><h3><b>Applications:</b></h3><ul><li>Telecom Providers: Ideal for delivering reliable and scalable EPON network services.</li><li>FTTH Networks: Perfect for deploying fiber-to-the-home (FTTH) broadband connections for residential and business users.</li><li>ISPs &amp; Network Operators: Best for scaling EPON networks and improving broadband delivery to customers.</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                    \n\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-6 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-reviews\">\n                <form class=\"form-horizontal\" id=\"form-review\">\n  <div id=\"review\"><p>There are no reviews for this product.</p> </div>\n  <h4>Write a review</h4>\n        <div class=\"form-group required\">\n      <label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\" for=\"input-name\">Your Name</label>\n      <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" value=\"\" id=\"input-name\" class=\"form-control\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"form-group required\">\n      <label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\" for=\"input-review\">Your Review</label>\n      <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n        <textarea name=\"text\" rows=\"5\" id=\"input-review\" class=\"form-control\"></textarea>\n        <div class=\"help-block\"><span class=\"text-danger\">Note:</span> HTML is not translated!</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"form-group required\">\n      <label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\">Rating</label>\n\n      <div class=\"col-sm-10 rate\">\n        <span>Bad</span>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"1